  "notes": [
    "Labels are case-sensitive in Jira. Always use lowercase with hyphens.",
    "When using custom fields (admin upgrade), keep some labels for cross-cutting queries.",
    "Recommended: macro-X and phase-X are kept as labels even after custom fields upgrade.",
    "compliance labels (traceability-thread-complete, etc.) are CRITICAL for audit JQL."
  ]
}
